      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Well i found a weird solution to this problem, I also was having the same issues when it came to loading up worlds and issues with loading avatars and receiving no notifications, once I deleted VRchat from steam i deleted the remaining files by running Windows Run Log (Windows key + R) then going to %appdata% and opening Local Low then deleting the remaing vrc files, then try re-downloading VRC, once that was done my issues were gone.",
